# Local Worker secrets. `.dev.vars` feeds `wrangler dev`; `.env.dev` and
# `.env.prod` are the sources `secrets:push:*` uploads to Cloudflare. All of
# them are plaintext credentials — never commit one. Ignored by pattern rather
# than by name so a `.env.staging` someone adds later is covered too.
.dev.vars
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# wrangler's local state: simulated KV, queues and secrets store.
.wrangler
